  "title": "Bit Digital, Inc. Announces Date for Second Quarter 2025 Financial Results and Conference Call",
  "summary": "Bit Digital, Inc. (Nasdaq: BTBT), announced today that it will release its Second Quarter 2025 results on Thursday, August 14, 2025, after the stock market closes. Senior management will host a live webcast and conference call to review on August 15, 2025, at 10:00 a.m. ET.",
